  <p class="small-text" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <strong>Satisfaction with Evaluations</strong> - JS&A guarantees that all evaluations are prepared by highly qualified evaluators, but it cannot guarantee that the applicant will agree with the evaluation. Any questions or concerns about evaluations must be submitted in writing.
